(text "VCC: existing board 3V3 output. GND: system/controller ground.\nGPIO1 -> TRIG: output, initially LOW, approximately 12 us pulse.\nGPIO2 <- ECHO: input, firmware internal pull-down; direct connection scheme.\nAll four wires remain in the head; no added head-to-chassis signal wire." (at 20.32 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5d6194bd-dbb1-5d2c-9d8e-adea97e8de21))
(text "USER-SELECTED 3.3 V SCHEME - NOT ELECTRICAL ACCEPTANCE\nVerify module revision, 3V3 current margin, TRIG threshold and ECHO peak/off-state.\nDo NOT change module VCC to 5 V while ECHO remains directly connected.\nSignal IDs are NOT connector pad numbers; new header positions remain unassigned." (at 20.32 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid 37a42647-9bab-5131-86fb-8cbb13f8fa2b))
(text "No 5Vin / 12 V / switched MOS supply on U11.\nNo external level-shifter or pull-down value invented.\nSource: ultrasonic.cc + docs/ultrasonic-ranging.md.\nPhysical pin order / wiring / enclosure acoustics still need verification." (at 228.6 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid dfbaf915-f461-5ceb-a94f-4571938fb2c8))
)
